    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop trying to fill it\"... i don't even know what that means. i'm just so tired of the struggle. it's like every time i try to rebuild, the world just pushes me back down. i look at the future and i don't see anything. no jobs, no people, just more of this same emptiness. is there even any point in trying to carry this weight anymore? it feels like it's just dragging me down until there's nothing left.",
